  "description" : "http://anidb.net/ch149870 [Dias] finally returns home after decades of war. He`s hailed a hero and promptly rewarded with his own domain...which turns out to be little more than empty plains. Population: zero. Dias, who has only ever known battle, finds himself at a loss. How is he supposed to survive, let alone cultivate his territory into a thriving, prosperous dominion when there`s nothing but grass as far as he can see? Fortunately for Dias, a horned girl by the name of http://anidb.net/ch149869 [Alna] is about to show him there`s more to the plains than meets the eye!\nSource: J-Novel Club",
